've made a number of improvements to the game's artwork and UI. The current demo is now much closer to what the finished game will look and feel like!What's New in This Demo?1.New background artwork for dialogue scenes, bringing the Red Fox Tavern to life!2.A brand","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:51:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035906","verified_at":"2026-10-23T12:08:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3875830-1830797770232591","game_id":"steam-3875830","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo for ‘Tavern Maid's Daily Life’ is now available！","summary":"The demo for ‘Tavern Maid’s Daily Life’ is now available.It includes the Prologue and Chapter 1, covering about 8% of the full game.About Tavern Maid’s Daily LifeTavern Maid’s Daily Life is a casual, story-driven narrative game set in a Western fantasy world with an ensemble cast.You play as a maid working at the 'Red Fox Tavern', serving all kinds of customers and enjoying a cozy, eventful everyday life. Between casual chats and daily chores, you’ll gradually uncover the deeper stories and myst","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-23T09:09:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770232591","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3875830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:38Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3875830":"2026-10-26T11:01:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3875830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:38Z"},"4613070